{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":" \n こんにちは\n ハーフアップ姉妹です(((o(*ﾟ▽ﾟ*)o)))\n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHFZ1S0XV59EJ79YGEQTK3JX","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n こないだ\n ゆうかと\n ホワイトボードにお絵描きして\n 遊びました〜\n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHFZ1TD957EVD8K1ZP90M563","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n 相合傘♡\n \n \n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHFZ1VQ5MGH24C8W4ZPNFJ74","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n 握手会のときも\n カメラをタイマーにして\n いっぱい写真を撮りました♡\n \n 最近\n ゆうかちゃんが本物の妹っぽく\n なってる気がします（笑）\n \n \n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHFZ1X7R27ATWA4GWX7FXG6K","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n なかよし（笑）\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n そういえば！\n \n お母さんと江ノ島と鎌倉観光してきて\n 食べたアイスが美味しすぎました♡\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHFZ1Z3P36D4AWZ2TPV5YFR0","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n \n この、\n 極限まで濃くした抹茶のアイス！\n \n \n ちなみに\n 私のお気に入りは\n 鎌倉の小町通りのまめやさんの\n 試食です(((o(*ﾟ▽ﾟ*)o)))\n \n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHFZ21PAPB35G4JD9J5SZRPK","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n はいピース✌︎"}],"source":"archive"}